      "act": "THE FLAW",
      "role_note": "the one missing argument",
      "narration_text": "The flaw was one missing argument. In index information, the name is the dictionary key, not part of the definition. My script read it, and never passed it on. So every index was recreated under MongoDB's default name. The data was perfect. Only the labels were lost, and nothing complained.",
