    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "THE FIX",
      "role_note": "the idempotent index helper; the log line is the recommended addition, labeled as such",
      "narration_text": "Together with a teammate, I made index setup idempotent. One helper creates every index, and it treats already-exists conflicts, codes eighty-five and eighty-six, as well as thirteen and sixty-seven, as no-ops instead of crashing. Every collection's indexes now go through it, not just some. It's safe to run on every boot.",
