      "act": "LESSONS",
      "role_note": "the checklist; narration discusses the order, does not recite the card",
      "narration_text": "If I did this migration again, the order would change. Use the tool built for it. Check the indexes, not just the document counts, while the source still exists. Only then retire the old database. The code fix protects you when things go wrong, but the checklist is what stops it from happening.",
